\newlabel{fig:spectrum}{{4}{8}{\textbf {Accounts of compositionality differ in the capabilities they ask for.} Each card names a set of capabilities, its demand on decomposition, the accounts that ask for it and the systems of this paper that meet it. A blend loses its parts, and weak compositionality asks only that the system act on new combinations. Strong compositionality adds decomposition by a linear probe fixed in advance, and two stricter sets also fix the form of that decomposition.\relax }{figure.caption.4}{}}
